{{ ref: 619fa225-782b-496d-adfe-980a35744ea4 }}
- **Surface Area**: `crates/core` (cluster, pack, score, diversify), `--mode` / `-k` flags on `strata analyze`, `AnalyzeConfig { mode, candidates }`
--{ ref: 619fa225-782b-496d-adfe-980a35744ea4 }--
{{ ref: ae8b8cc1-8c37-43ae-994f-3712438ea09c }}
- **Description**: Proposes up to k genuinely different laminar restructures per mode. **Anchored** (μ > 0, path cohesion β > 0) keeps candidates reachable from today's layout; **greenfield** (μ = 0 and β = 0) computes the unbiased ideal — one solver, one objective, different coefficients (AD-2). Candidates within the score-tolerance band of the best are selected by max-min variation of information, so the returned set spans real alternatives instead of near-clones of one local optimum.
--{ ref: ae8b8cc1-8c37-43ae-994f-3712438ea09c }--
